# Trivy ignore file — temporarily suppress accepted CVEs
# Only add entries when:
#   1. The vuln is in a transitive dep we can't bump directly
#   2. There's a tracking issue or comment explaining WHY
#   3. Remove the entry as soon as the fix is available
#
# Format: one CVE/GHSA ID per line
# Example:
#   # GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz — waiting on controller-runtime to bump grpc
#   GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz
